;	000000000300086719	;	"	<p><strong>KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN.</strong></p><p><strong>DO NOT USE IF SAFETY SEAL IS BROKEN.</strong></p><p><strong>IF YOU ARE NURSING, PREGNANT, TAKING MEDICATION OR HAVE A MEDICAL CONDITION, CONSULT YOUR PHYSICIAN BEFORE TAKING THIS PRODUCT.</strong></p> 	"